    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/0eaebe6d66673da9e0a1a50de112717e.avif?t=1685538800\" /></div><br>Energy Survivors is an action roguelite where you slay hordes of enemies and face bosses. Your only objective is to steal the energy of their planet and survive. Play as a mercenary, and with the spoils of every run upgrade your weapons, unlock new suits, and upgrade your skill tree.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original soundtrack, designed to keep players fully immersed in the gameplay experience<br></li><li>Simple and intuitive controls that are easy to learn<br></li><li>Over 30 upgrades available for skills, weapons, and characters<br></li><li>Variety of Mutation Injectors to choose from, granting unique passive effects that change the gameplay experience in each run.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">shoot them all</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/ddfea28db4a3ddb15d809804b0a745ac.poster.avif?t=1685538800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/ddfea28db4a3ddb15d809804b0a745ac.webm?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/ddfea28db4a3ddb15d809804b0a745ac.mp4?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose one upgrade</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/b64219a15fc41e8d2efaea63172b0046.poster.avif?t=1685538800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/b64219a15fc41e8d2efaea63172b0046.webm?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/b64219a15fc41e8d2efaea63172b0046.mp4?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get powerful skills</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/cfabc4b54bd314e9bd7239e3308b28dc.poster.avif?t=1685538800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/cfabc4b54bd314e9bd7239e3308b28dc.webm?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/cfabc4b54bd314e9bd7239e3308b28dc.mp4?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/0eaebe6d66673da9e0a1a50de112717e.avif?t=1685538800\" /></div><br>Energy Survivors is an action roguelite where you slay hordes of enemies and face bosses. Your only objective is to steal the energy of their planet and survive. Play as a mercenary, and with the spoils of every run upgrade your weapons, unlock new suits, and upgrade your skill tree.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original soundtrack, designed to keep players fully immersed in the gameplay experience<br></li><li>Simple and intuitive controls that are easy to learn<br></li><li>Over 30 upgrades available for skills, weapons, and characters<br></li><li>Variety of Mutation Injectors to choose from, granting unique passive effects that change the gameplay experience in each run.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">shoot them all</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/ddfea28db4a3ddb15d809804b0a745ac.poster.avif?t=1685538800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/ddfea28db4a3ddb15d809804b0a745ac.webm?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/ddfea28db4a3ddb15d809804b0a745ac.mp4?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose one upgrade</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/b64219a15fc41e8d2efaea63172b0046.poster.avif?t=1685538800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/b64219a15fc41e8d2efaea63172b0046.webm?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/b64219a15fc41e8d2efaea63172b0046.mp4?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get powerful skills</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/cfabc4b54bd314e9bd7239e3308b28dc.poster.avif?t=1685538800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/cfabc4b54bd314e9bd7239e3308b28dc.webm?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145190/extras/cfabc4b54bd314e9bd7239e3308b28dc.mp4?t=1685538800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>",
    "short_description": "In Energy Survivors, you play as a mercenary in a third-person shooter roguelite game. Your mission is to invade a hostile planet in search of its energy source. You can choose from a variety of upgrades to create unique and powerful builds that can change the course of the game.",
